3. `00_ARCHITECTURE/PROJECT_ARCHITECTURE_v2_2.md` (canonical_id `PROJECT_ARCHITECTURE`; v2.1 SUPERSEDED 2026-04-24 at Step 5A — do not cite). Governing blueprint. Re-read relevant sections as needed.
